{"pageid":3834,"title":"Ice Golem Shop","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Ice Golem Shop</span>","revid":19759,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Ice Golem Shop</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/26/Ice_Golem_Shop.png/revision/latest?cb=20250211022405\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Ice Golem Shop\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/26/Ice_Golem_Shop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250211022405\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/26/Ice_Golem_Shop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250211022405 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/26/Ice_Golem_Shop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20250211022405 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Ice Golem Shop\" width=\"270\" height=\"175\" data-image-key=\"Ice_Golem_Shop.png\" data-image-name=\"Ice Golem Shop.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Icelands\" title=\"Icelands\">Icelands (Ice Caves)</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"NPC\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">NPC</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raffina_Caldera\" title=\"Raffina Caldera\">Raffina Caldera</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.71</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\nThe <b>Ice Golem Shop</b> is a store located in the bottom of the <a href=\"/wiki/Icelands\" title=\"Icelands\">Ice Caves</a>. The store's location is pretty easy to get to but requires the use of a <a href=\"/wiki/Flamethrower\" title=\"Flamethrower\">Flamethrower</a>.\n</p><p>The store is located behind an ice wall that can only be destroyed by use of a <a href=\"/wiki/Flamethrower\" title=\"Flamethrower\">Flamethrower</a> or using 3x <a href=\"/wiki/Small_Bomb\" title=\"Small Bomb\">Small Bombs</a>. \n</p><p>The store is run by an NPC called <a href=\"/wiki/Raffina_Caldera\" title=\"Raffina Caldera\">Raffina Caldera</a> (A species similar to that of <a href=\"/wiki/Lumi_Laurence\" title=\"Lumi Laurence\">Lumi Laurence</a> which is a Ancient Golem)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Inventory\">Inventory</span></h2>\n<p>this table shows all items available at the store.\n</p>\n<table class=\"fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><b>Name</b>\n</th>\n<th><b>Picture</b>\n</th>\n<th><b>Price</b>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Icecrest_Pickaxe\" title=\"Icecrest Pickaxe\">IceCrest Pickaxe</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/65/Icecrest_Pickaxe.png/revision/latest?cb=20241210234942\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Icecrest Pickaxe\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/65/Icecrest_Pickaxe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/205?cb=20241210234942\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"205\" height=\"238\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icecrest Pickaxe.png\" data-image-key=\"Icecrest_Pickaxe.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>$24,000</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Icecrest_Axe\" title=\"Icecrest Axe\">IceCrest Axe</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a2/Icecrest_axe.png/revision/latest?cb=20250222094157\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Icecrest axe\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a2/Icecrest_axe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250222094157\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icecrest axe.png\" data-image-key=\"Icecrest_axe.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>$24,000</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Celestial_Chisel\" title=\"Celestial Chisel\">Celestial Chisel</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2e/Celestialchisel.png/revision/latest?cb=20250309090439\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Celestialchisel\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/2e/Celestialchisel.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250309090439\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"319\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Celestialchisel.png\" data-image-key=\"Celestialchisel.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>$24,000</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sled\" title=\"Sled\">Sled</a>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f8/Sled.png/revision/latest?cb=20241208203853\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Sled\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"365\" height=\"167\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Sled.png\" data-image-key=\"Sled.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f8/Sled.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/365?cb=20241208203853\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul><li>$1,400</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Frozen_lantern\" title=\"Frozen lantern\">Frozen lantern</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0c/Frozenlantern2.png/revision/latest?cb=20250309090609\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Frozenlantern2\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\"